@startuml state-operation
!pragma layout smetana
' Client-side lifecycle of a data-changing operation (PendingOperation.status)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F7F9FC
  BorderColor #2E4A7D
}

[*] --> SENDING : user confirms\n(operationId generated)
SENDING --> COMPLETED : 2xx response
SENDING --> REJECTED : 4xx business error\n(422, 409)
SENDING --> UNCERTAIN : timeout / connection lost /\n5xx after sending
UNCERTAIN --> COMPLETED : GET /operations/{id}\n-> COMPLETED
UNCERTAIN --> REJECTED : GET /operations/{id}\n-> REJECTED
UNCERTAIN --> NOT_EXECUTED : GET /operations/{id}\n-> 404
NOT_EXECUTED --> SENDING : user taps Retry\n(same operationId)
NOT_EXECUTED --> [*] : user dismisses
COMPLETED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]

note right of UNCERTAIN
While any operation is UNCERTAIN,
new deposits / trades are blocked and
balances are labelled "pending confirmation".
end note
@enduml
